# Model identifiers that ConfigKeys may ship as defaults.
# DefaultModelIdsTest fails when a DEFAULT_*_MODEL constant is not listed here, so changing a
# default means editing this file on purpose. Each entry was checked against the vendor's own
# model catalogue on 2026-11-06:
#   ollama    https://ollama.com/library/<name>  (tags page lists the exact tag)
#   anthropic https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations  (status Active)
#   openai    https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/<id>
# Format: <provider> <model id>, one per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
ollama qwen2.5:3b
ollama nomic-embed-text
anthropic claude-sonnet-5-5
openai gpt-6-luna
